  "name": null,
  "problem": "Find the partial derivatives of $\\text{div}\\,V$ at the point $(1,1).$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202x}(\\text{div}\\,V)\\,{|}_{(1,\\,1)}=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                                \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202y}(\\text{div}\\,V)\\,{|}_{(1,\\,1)}=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-2}}",
  "worked_solution": "First, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202x}(\\text{div}\\,V) & =\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202x}(2xy+2x) \\\\  & =2y+2 \\\\ \\frac{\u2202}{\u2202y}(\\text{div}\\,V) & =\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202y}(2xy+2x) \\\\  & =2x+0 \\\\  & =2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n    \n\nFinally, we evaluate the partial derivative at the point $(1,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\u2202}{\u2202x}(\\text{div}\\,V)\\,{|}_{(1,\\,1)} & =2(1)+2 \\\\  & =4 \\\\ \\frac{\u2202}{\u2202y}(\\text{div}\\,V)\\,{|}_{(1,\\,1)} & =2(1) \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$",
